  "title": "Brazil’s Lula and Bolsonaro Reclaim Power to Launch Presidential Elections",
  "summary": "Brazil’s Lula da Silva, the leftwing president, has launched his historic fourth term campaign, while his far-right counterpart, Jair Bolsonaro, appeals to Brazil’s voters to combat rising femicide and gender violence. Both candidates have faced significant challenges in their political ascent.",
